{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-04-04 06:00:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE AND KOGAS SIGN MOU EXPLORING NEW INFRASTRUCTURE OPPORTUNITIES FOR ENERGY TRANSITION', 'text': "SAN DIEGO , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE), AND KOREA GAS CORPORATION (KOGAS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPANIES HAVE ENTERED INTO A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) TO EXPLORE OPPORTUNITIES TO COOPERATE IN THE GLOBAL ENERGY TRANSITION TO LOWER-CARBON AND ZERO-CARBON FUELS. THE MOU CONTEMPLATES THE COMPANIES' JOINT COLLABORATION AROUND PROJECT DEVELOPMENT AND OFFTAKE ACROSS MULTIPLE BUSINESS AREAS, INCLUDING LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG), CARBON CAPTURE AND SEQUESTRATION, AND HYDROGEN INFRASTRUCTURE."}